* ==========================================================================
* CPLEX option file 4 (FACTOR PROBE): barrier-only, to MEASURE the 2030-cohort
* Cholesky factor that concurrent LPmethod 6 hides.
* The 2030 cohort LP is identical to the uncapped A1 run, so this number IS
* A1's barrier factor (the tractability metric: full-CCS=2.0e9, msw=594M).
* Run, capture "Total non-zeros in factor / FP ops / dense columns / Reduced
* LP size" from the FIRST (2030) cohort, then KILL. (LPmethod 4 later fails
* with LP status 22 on this PB matrix -- irrelevant; factor prints first.)
* Use with: gams ... --USEOPTIONFILE=4
* ==========================================================================

LPmethod  4
* Barrier ONLY -> emits "Summary statistics for Cholesky factor".

advind 0
predual -1
scaind 1
solutiontype 0
numericalemphasis 1
* (mirror the production numerics so the measured factor is representative.)

bardisplay 2
* REQUIRED: emits Cholesky factor summary + dense-column count + per-iter log.
